11:["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-12","children":["$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a",["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"萌通加速能用 Clash 或小火箭吗？\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"不能。官方面板公告明确写着已切换到自研抗封锁协议，Clash、Shadowrocket（小火箭）等第三方软件暂时无法支持这个协议，必须使用萌通加速官方客户端连接。官方提供 Windows、macOS、Android、iOS 四端客户端。\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"萌通加速跑路了吗？靠谱吗？\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"截至 2026 年 7 月 28 日核实，萌通加速在正常运营：面板可登录、套餐可购买、客服气泡在线，也没有出现在常见的跑路机场名单里。但它的域名注册记录都很新（面板域 moetor.us 注册于 2025 年 10 月，中文主域名注册于 2026 年 3 月），公开的第三方评测几乎搜不到，属于没有口碑积累的小站，建议先月付试。\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"萌通加速的优惠码 DW2026 还能用吗？\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"不能。DW2026 是 2026 年端午节活动码，官方标注的截止时间是 2026 年 6 月 21 日 23:59:59，早已过期，只是面板公告一直没撤。截至本文核实日，萌通加速没有公开在用的优惠码，新用户福利是注册后免费体验 1 小时（1GB 流量）。\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"萌通加速的官网是哪个？\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"官方面板公告里写明主域名是「萌通加速.com」、备用域名是「萌通加速.net」，此外还在用 app.moetor.us（面板）、aff.mtcloud.us（推广）等多个域名。多域名并存在机场里很常见，但也意味着钓鱼站容易冒名，认准面板公告里公布的域名。\"}}]}"}}],["$","blockquote",null,{"className":"my-6 border-l-2 border-accent bg-card py-3 pr-3 pl-4 font-serif text-lg leading-8 text-foreground/85 not-italic","children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"30 秒结论"}]}],["$","$1","1",{"children":["：萌通加速的价格没什么问题——¥10/100G 入门，每 GB 单价 ¥0.06～¥0.13，处在",["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/pianyijichang","className":"text-accent hover:underline","children":"便宜机场"}],"的正常区间。真正需要你想清楚的是另一件事：它已经全面切换到自研协议，Clash、小火箭统统连不上，只能装它自己的客户端。这带来的不只是「换个软件」，而是你手上的订阅无法被任何第三方工具验证、导出或迁移。加上面板域名 2025 年下半年才注册、全网几乎找不到第三方评测，结论是："]}],["$","$1","2",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"可以用小额月付试，但别年付、别当唯一线路。"}]}]]}],"\n"]}],["$L1b",["$","h2",null,{"id":"萌通加速是什么-一家没有口碑积累的新站","className":"mt-12 mb-4 scroll-mt-28 border-b border-rule pb-2 font-serif text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight lg:scroll-mt-20","children":"萌通加速是什么：一家没有口碑积累的新站"}]],["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":"萌通加速（英文 Moetor）是一家中文机场，主打「全球网络加速」，提供 Windows、macOS、Android、iOS 四端官方客户端，套餐从 ¥10/月起，宣传解锁 ChatGPT、Gemini、Netflix、Disney+。"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":"它到底开了多久，官网没写。所以我去查了域名注册记录（这是一手证据，比任何自我介绍都硬）："}],["$","dl",null,{"className":"my-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-10 sm:grid-cols-2","children":[["$","div","萌通.com（导航页）",{"className":"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-rule py-2.5","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"shrink-0 text-sm text-muted","children":"萌通.com（导航页）"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"text-right text-sm font-medium","children":"2024 年 8 月注册"}]]}],["$","div","app.moetor.us（用户面板）",{"className":"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-rule py-2.5","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"shrink-0 text-sm text-muted","children":"app.moetor.us（用户面板）"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"text-right text-sm font-medium","children":"2025 年 10 月注册"}]]}],["$","div","aff.mtcloud.us（推广域名）",{"className":"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-rule py-2.5","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"shrink-0 text-sm text-muted","children":"aff.mtcloud.us（推广域名）"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"text-right text-sm font-medium","children":"2026 年 1 月注册"}]]}],["$","div","萌通加速.com / .net（主域名）",{"className":"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-rule py-2.5","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"shrink-0 text-sm text-muted","children":"萌通加速.com / .net（主域名）"}],"$L1c"]}],"$L1d","$L1e"]}],"$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24"